2Sa 24:1 , David, tempted by Satan, forces Joab to number the people;
2Sa 24:5 , The captains, in nine months and twenty days, bring the muster of thirteen hundred thousand fighting men;
2Sa 24:10 , David repents, and having three plagues propounded by God, chooses the three days' pestilence;
2Sa 24:15 , After the death of three score and ten thousand, David by prayer prevents the destruction of Jerusalem;
2Sa 24:18 , David, by God's direction, purchases Araunah's threshing floor; where having sacrificed, the plague stays.
